    "description": "Heading of the taximeter's own tariff form. It used to read «Км-ийн үнээ тохируул», which was already loose when a stopped-time rate joined the km one and became plainly wrong when the trip-duration rate made three -- a driver was told the screen sets the km price while three different prices sat under the heading."
