    "description": "The stopped-time rate on the offline taximeter's tariff form. Renamed 2026-08-01 from «хүлээлгэ» (waiting) to «түгжрэл/зогсолт» (jam/stop) at the author's request: what this rate actually bills is a car standing still in Ulaanbaatar traffic, and «хүлээлгэ» reads to a driver as waiting for a passenger who has not come down yet. The key name is left as it was on purpose -- renaming it would churn every call site for a wording change."
  },
