    "description": "The third rate on the offline taximeter's tariff form (added 2026-08-01): every minute of the trip, moving or stopped. Its own key rather than a reuse of driverProfileDurationTariffFieldLabel because the meter and the published profile are two separate forms that happen to price the same thing -- exactly as meterWaitTariffFieldLabel and driverProfileWaitTariffFieldLabel already are."
  },
  "meterDurationTariffHint": "Аялал эхэлснээс дуустал минут тутамд — явж байсан ч, зогссон ч. 0 бол үнэгүй.",
  "@meterDurationTariffHint": {
    "description": "Spells out the one thing that distinguishes this rate from the stopped-time rate above it: it runs the whole time. It deliberately says nothing about the two overlapping when both are set -- the author decided that is the driver's own commercial call, not something the app warns about."
  },
