    "description": "Says exactly what the rate bills -- start to finish, whether the car is moving or not -- because that is the one thing that distinguishes it from the stopped-time rate above it. It deliberately says nothing about the two overlapping when both are set: the author decided that is the driver's own commercial call, not something the app warns about."
  },
